{"verse_key": "10:10", "surah": 10, "verse": 10, "text_uthmani": "دَعْوَىٰهُمْ فِيهَا سُبْحَـٰنَكَ ٱللَّهُمَّ وَتَحِيَّتُهُمْ فِيهَا سَلَـٰمٌ ۚ وَءَاخِرُ دَعْوَىٰهُمْ أَنِ ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ", "translation": "Their call therein will be, \"Exalted are You, O Allāh,\" and their greeting therein will be, \"Peace.\" And the last of their call will be, \"Praise to Allāh, Lord of the worlds!\"", "verse_from_ms": 197480, "verse_to_ms": 216760, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "دَعْوَىٰهُمْ", "start_ms": 197480, "end_ms": 199100}, {"i": 1, "text": "فِيهَا", "start_ms": 199100, "end_ms": 199830}, {"i": 2, "text": "سُبْحَـٰنَكَ", "start_ms": 199830, "end_ms": 200950}, {"i": 3, "text": "ٱللَّهُمَّ", "start_ms": 200950, "end_ms": 202570}, {"i": 4, "text": "وَتَحِيَّتُهُمْ", "start_ms": 202570, "end_ms": 204160}, {"i": 5, "text": "فِيهَا", "start_ms": 204160, "end_ms": 204940}, {"i": 6, "text": "سَلَـٰمٌ", "start_ms": 204940, "end_ms": 207530}, {"i": 7, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 207530, "end_ms": 209290}, {"i": 8, "text": "وَءَاخِرُ", "start_ms": 209290, "end_ms": 210540}, {"i": 9, "text": "دَعْوَىٰهُمْ", "start_ms": 210540, "end_ms": 210930}, {"i": 10, "text": "أَنِ", "start_ms": 210930, "end_ms": 211700}, {"i": 11, "text": "ٱلْحَمْدُ", "start_ms": 211700, "end_ms": 212690}, {"i": 12, "text": "لِلَّهِ", "start_ms": 212690, "end_ms": 213210}, {"i": 13, "text": "رَبِّ", "start_ms": 213210, "end_ms": 216325}, {"i": 14, "text": "ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}